          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi amma tana waan AABBO Waaqi guddaani Israeli jed'u ch'aqasa: Isani nyaapa kiyya, anini amma haalo isani fuud'a aka isani deebitani na ingaargalchine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini isaniti garagale, aka sibiila isani basse t'uri teesani ch'ufa isani iraa baasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini worra isani fidufi ka isani gorsu, akuma duri isanii kenne kaani isanii kenna. Duuba Yerusalemule dira d'uga jabeesu, jed'aniini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
